Dear Karen,

I suspect you have used the wrong read function for your NTS file. See here for more details: https://github.com/geomorphR/geomorph/wiki/Reading-NTS-files

Basically, there are two file types, and if you've used the wrong one, H will not be formatted correctly. Check the dim() of H to make sure it is a 3D array with dimensions you are expecting.

Emma

