Hi Viviana,

if you use rgl.open() before running plotRefToTarget you should get a new rgl device and the grid will then be plotted in that new device. Make sure to adjust the device settings according to your preference through the rgl.open arguments.

Hope this helps,
All the best,
Antigoni

